== file Search
POST {{base_url}}/graphql
```graphql
query { users { id name } }
```
== file Upload avatar
POST {{base_url}}/upload
[Form]
caption: hello {{name}}
[BasicAuth]
admin: {{admin_password}}
== file Users/Get user
GET {{base_url}}/users/{{id}}
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
[Options]
variable: id="1"
== file Users/List users
GET {{base_url}}/users
X-Api-Key: {{api_key}}
[Query]
active: true
HTTP 200
== extra secrets/local.secrets (keep=true)
api_key=
== sonde.yaml
version: 1
environments:
  Local:
    variables:
      base_url: http://localhost:3000
    secrets_files:
      - secrets/local.secrets
  default:
    variables:
      base_url: https://api.example.com
defaults:
  env: default
warning secret: Local: secret variable "api_key" has no value in the output; fill it in the secrets stub
